{"slug": "C_S03E16", "video_name": "Community - S03E16 - Virtual Systems Analysis Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S03E16 - Virtual Systems Analysis Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1272.985, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 542, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.7, "text": "We are so screwed."}, {"start": 2.7, "end": 8.4, "text": "How are we going to memorize all this?"}, {"start": 8.4, "end": 10.134901960784314, "text": "Let's just go over it again."}, {"start": 10.134901960784314, "end": 11.56, "text": "Kingdom, phylum, class."}, {"start": 11.56, "end": 15.08, "text": "Order, family, genus, species."}, {"start": 15.08, "end": 17.896, "text": "I use a mnemonic device."}, {"start": 17.896, "end": 22.12, "text": "Kevin, please come over for gay sex."}, {"start": 22.12, "end": 23.52, "text": "Why wouldn't you use Karen?"}, {"start": 23.52, "end": 25.52, "text": "Because it's gay sex, dummy."}, {"start": 25.52, "end": 26.39578947368421, "text": "So you use..."}, {"start": 26.39578947368421, "end": 26.8, "text": "great."}, {"start": 26.8, "end": 28.16216216216216, "text": "Now I can't remember anything."}, {"start": 28.16216216216216, "end": 28.48, "text": "Thanks."}, {"start": 28.48, "end": 30.33483870967742, "text": "God, why do we always end up in this position?"}, {"start": 30.33483870967742, "end": 33.48, "text": "For all the time you spend here, you'd think we wouldn't have to cram so much."}, {"start": 33.48, "end": 36.08, "text": "Maybe we never get any work done because we have so much money around together."}, {"start": 36.08, "end": 38.28, "text": "Definitely, maybe, that's why."}, {"start": 40.28, "end": 42.52390243902439, "text": "Ah, the duality of man."}, {"start": 42.52390243902439, "end": 48.28, "text": "I'm dressed this way because I have good news and bad news."}, {"start": 48.28, "end": 50.28, "text": "You have got to be kidding me."}, {"start": 50.28, "end": 53.18, "text": "The bad news is Professor Kane has the flu."}, {"start": 53.18, "end": 56.08, "text": "The good news is biology class is canceled."}, {"start": 56.08, "end": 56.59612903225806, "text": "Bam."}, {"start": 56.59612903225806, "end": 57.88645161290322, "text": "After you."}, {"start": 57.88645161290322, "end": 60.08, "text": "What a gentleman."}, {"start": 60.08, "end": 63.59219512195122, "text": "Guys, we don't have to cram last minute anymore."}, {"start": 63.59219512195122, "end": 66.08, "text": "Last minute got moved to tomorrow."}, {"start": 66.08, "end": 68.08, "text": "Three hour lunch, three hour lunch, three hour lunch."}, {"start": 68.08, "end": 68.71157894736842, "text": "Three hours?"}, {"start": 68.71157894736842, "end": 71.08, "text": "I could watch the first half of three movies."}, {"start": 71.08, "end": 73.63238095238096, "text": "Well, I don't have to go to the fancy west front across the street."}, {"start": 73.63238095238096, "end": 75.08, "text": "I can go to the fancy one across town."}, {"start": 75.08, "end": 76.08, "text": "Your manager wears a tie."}, {"start": 76.08, "end": 77.5557281553398, "text": "If we don't eat, we can make believe a"}, {"start": 77.5557281553398, "end": 80.08, "text": "whole episode's worth of Inspector Spacetime in the Dreamatorium."}, {"start": 80.08, "end": 80.58, "text": "Word."}, {"start": 80.58, "end": 81.08, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 82.08, "end": 83.56, "text": "Maybe we should go to Senior Kevin's."}, {"start": 83.56, "end": 86.08, "text": "Britta, didn't you want to try that new cage free bean burrito?"}, {"start": 86.08, "end": 88.64363636363636, "text": "The tortillas are made with microfinance flour."}, {"start": 88.64363636363636, "end": 89.84363636363636, "text": "Troy, you could drive."}, {"start": 89.84363636363636, "end": 92.08, "text": "You always like that spiral parking ramp."}, {"start": 92.08, "end": 94.08, "text": "You just keep turning left, but you end up up."}, {"start": 94.08, "end": 95.14422018348624, "text": "I can't go to Senior Kevin's."}, {"start": 95.14422018348624, "end": 96.2451376146789, "text": "The manager and I are enemies."}, {"start": 96.2451376146789, "end": 97.16256880733944, "text": "He said Die Hard was bad."}, {"start": 97.16256880733944, "end": 98.08, "text": "He said Die Hard was bad."}, {"start": 98.08, "end": 99.08, "text": "I know, buddy."}, {"start": 99.08, "end": 100.28491803278688, "text": "Well, how about this?"}, {"start": 100.28491803278688, "end": 102.46524590163934, "text": "This lunch is already a runaway train."}, {"start": 102.46524590163934, "end": 103.84229508196721, "text": "No point in stopping it."}, {"start": 103.84229508196721, "end": 106.08, "text": "Troy, Britta, you go to Senior Kevin's."}, {"start": 106.08, "end": 107.98588235294118, "text": "Abed promised he'd show me how the Dreamatorium works."}, {"start": 107.98588235294118, "end": 109.08, "text": "Today's the perfect day for it."}, {"start": 109.08, "end": 112.08, "text": "But I want to-- Abed, don't you think today's the perfect day for it?"}, {"start": 112.08, "end": 113.08, "text": "No."}, {"start": 113.08, "end": 114.08, "text": "Abed?"}, {"start": 114.08, "end": 115.08, "text": "Is this a social cue?"}, {"start": 116.08, "end": 119.08, "text": "I left my putting on the Ritz-Cannon here earlier."}, {"start": 120.08, "end": 125.08, "text": "I know it probably has another name, but can I be perfectly honest with you guys?"}, {"start": 125.08, "end": 128.34470588235294, "text": "I think I went too far with this one."}, {"start": 128.34470588235294, "end": 131.08, "text": "I have to go to the bank today."}, {"start": 131.08, "end": 134.03774647887326, "text": "What am I supposed to tell people in line?"}, {"start": 134.03774647887326, "end": 136.08, "text": "I had good news and bad news."}, {"start": 137.08, "end": 138.2642105263158, "text": "Come on, Craig."}, {"start": 138.2642105263158, "end": 140.08, "text": "Get your life together."}, {"start": 168.08, "end": 175.08, "text": "I am Inspector Spacetime, and I know that which is unknown."}, {"start": 175.08, "end": 179.8988976377953, "text": "Duty-bound to protect a universe of innocent unremarkables, I patrol"}, {"start": 179.8988976377953, "end": 184.08, "text": "it in the X-7 Dimensionizer with my loyal constable Reggie."}, {"start": 184.08, "end": 189.57397590361447, "text": "This week, however, Reggie has been forced to go to lunch, so I'm aboard the"}, {"start": 189.57397590361447, "end": 196.08, "text": "much crappier HMS Spacetime 12 from the worst season ever with temporary constable Geneva."}, {"start": 196.08, "end": 196.59851851851852, "text": "Geneva!"}, {"start": 196.59851851851852, "end": 197.11703703703702, "text": "Geneva!"}, {"start": 197.11703703703702, "end": 200.08, "text": "I need the quantum spanner, the big one!"}, {"start": 200.08, "end": 201.08, "text": "Oi, governor!"}, {"start": 201.08, "end": 204.08, "text": "Quantum spanner, open at 'em, ain't it?"}, {"start": 207.08, "end": 210.08, "text": "If we can't get out of over the lock, the Blorgons may intercept."}, {"start": 210.08, "end": 211.03238095238098, "text": "Ta-ta, my lord."}, {"start": 211.03238095238098, "end": 214.08, "text": "Wouldn't give a tuppence for that sticky wicket."}, {"start": 215.08, "end": 217.08, "text": "Okay, stop simulation."}, {"start": 217.08, "end": 218.08, "text": "More British?"}, {"start": 218.08, "end": 220.08, "text": "I can't do this anymore."}, {"start": 220.08, "end": 222.08, "text": "But the Blorgons might intercept--"}, {"start": 222.08, "end": 223.28, "text": "It's Blorgons with an R?"}, {"start": 223.28, "end": 225.08, "text": "Blorgon means thank you and Blorgon."}, {"start": 225.08, "end": 229.08, "text": "Can't we play something I know about, like hospital administration?"}, {"start": 231.08, "end": 234.32468085106385, "text": "You're mad at me for playing matchmaker with Troy and Britta."}, {"start": 234.32468085106385, "end": 236.08, "text": "You think you're gonna lose Troy?"}, {"start": 236.08, "end": 237.05674418604653, "text": "I'm not petty, Annie."}, {"start": 237.05674418604653, "end": 240.08, "text": "I'm mad at you because you tampered with the fabric of the group."}, {"start": 240.08, "end": 242.59773049645392, "text": "How do you know Troy and Britta pairing up wouldn't destroy everything?"}, {"start": 242.59773049645392, "end": 243.30695035460994, "text": "I run the scenarios."}, {"start": 243.30695035460994, "end": 245.08, "text": "I examine this stuff from every conceivable angle."}, {"start": 245.08, "end": 246.68869565217392, "text": "Oh, and you can do that, but I can't?"}, {"start": 246.68869565217392, "end": 249.08, "text": "You don't have a patent on being a control freak, Abed."}, {"start": 249.08, "end": 249.5940186915888, "text": "I kinda do."}, {"start": 249.5940186915888, "end": 251.46317757009345, "text": "You think this is just a room where Troy"}, {"start": 251.46317757009345, "end": 254.08, "text": "and I play dinosaurs versus riverboat gamblers together?"}, {"start": 254.08, "end": 256.30727272727273, "text": "Sure, that's how I got the construction approved."}, {"start": 256.30727272727273, "end": 259.08, "text": "But, much like myself, the Dreamatorium has higher functions."}, {"start": 259.08, "end": 260.4055813953488, "text": "Would you like me to show you how your"}, {"start": 260.4055813953488, "end": 262.08, "text": "stunt with Troy and Britta will play itself out?"}, {"start": 262.08, "end": 263.08, "text": "Why not?"}, {"start": 263.08, "end": 264.15042253521125, "text": "Execute simulation."}, {"start": 264.15042253521125, "end": 265.1645070422535, "text": "Troy slash Britta."}, {"start": 265.1645070422535, "end": 266.23492957746475, "text": "Render environment."}, {"start": 266.23492957746475, "end": 267.08, "text": "Signor Kevin's."}, {"start": 269.08, "end": 272.08, "text": "Ooh, those appetizers were dope and legit."}, {"start": 273.08, "end": 276.08, "text": "I don't usually support lunch because it's unfair to breakfast."}, {"start": 277.08, "end": 280.08, "text": "I never thought about meals fighting each other."}, {"start": 281.08, "end": 285.08, "text": "I guess that explains why you never see any two of them on the same table."}, {"start": 285.08, "end": 287.08, "text": "So I guess Annie's pretty hot to get us together."}, {"start": 287.08, "end": 290.08, "text": "She probably just doesn't understand people."}, {"start": 290.08, "end": 293.08, "text": "Well, the sooner the food comes, the sooner this will be over."}, {"start": 294.08, "end": 297.08, "text": "I'm afraid your food won't be ready for another half hour."}, {"start": 297.08, "end": 300.08, "text": "I'm too busy misunderstanding the whole point of Die Hard."}, {"start": 302.08, "end": 304.08, "text": "I can't wait to get home, Abed."}, {"start": 305.08, "end": 307.760412371134, "text": "So you can dart back and forth doing impressions of your friends."}, {"start": 307.760412371134, "end": 309.08, "text": "There's no science at work here."}, {"start": 310.08, "end": 311.08, "text": "You're right."}, {"start": 313.08, "end": 314.08, "text": "The science is at work in here."}, {"start": 318.08, "end": 320.08, "text": "This is the Dreamatorium's engine."}, {"start": 321.08, "end": 322.8082608695652, "text": "My thoughts are collected by this box, and everything"}, {"start": 322.8082608695652, "end": 324.08, "text": "I know about my friends is stored here."}, {"start": 324.08, "end": 328.08, "text": "Both are distilled by logic and then recombined into objective observation."}, {"start": 328.08, "end": 329.85777777777776, "text": "I'm able to simulate any of the study group, and"}, {"start": 329.85777777777776, "end": 332.08, "text": "even a half-accurate Chang, in over 7,000 unique situations."}, {"start": 333.08, "end": 336.08, "text": "Abed, it's cardboard tubes and a funnel."}, {"start": 336.08, "end": 339.08, "text": "You see it that way because it's calibrated to a specific level of brain function."}, {"start": 339.08, "end": 339.78588235294114, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 339.78588235294114, "end": 341.08, "text": "I'm stupid."}, {"start": 341.08, "end": 341.58, "text": "Not stupid."}, {"start": 341.58, "end": 343.08, "text": "Just less able to see what I see."}, {"start": 344.08, "end": 346.08, "text": "Gee, you've got it all figured out."}, {"start": 349.08, "end": 351.08, "text": "King of toilet paper rolls over here."}, {"start": 353.08, "end": 353.56387096774193, "text": "Hey, Troy."}, {"start": 353.56387096774193, "end": 354.5316129032258, "text": "I'm glad you called."}, {"start": 354.5316129032258, "end": 356.08, "text": "Your lunch is going well, right?"}, {"start": 356.08, "end": 359.08, "text": "Yeah, just checking in on Abed, making sure he's okay."}, {"start": 360.08, "end": 360.4371428571428, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 360.4371428571428, "end": 361.15142857142854, "text": "He's fine."}, {"start": 361.15142857142854, "end": 367.08, "text": "He just implied I operate on a lower level of brain function, so business as usual."}, {"start": 368.08, "end": 368.3957894736842, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 368.3957894736842, "end": 371.08, "text": "Um, just, you know, make sure he stays comfortable."}, {"start": 371.08, "end": 373.08, "text": "I worry about him when I'm not around."}, {"start": 374.08, "end": 375.118961038961, "text": "Well, he's fine."}, {"start": 375.118961038961, "end": 376.28779220779217, "text": "He always will be."}, {"start": 376.28779220779217, "end": 379.08, "text": "People bend over backwards to cater to him."}, {"start": 379.08, "end": 381.2704761904762, "text": "He's just extra sensitive in the Dreamatorium."}, {"start": 381.2704761904762, "end": 383.36571428571426, "text": "It takes a lot out of him to run that thing."}, {"start": 383.36571428571426, "end": 385.08, "text": "I don't want you to break his brain."}, {"start": 385.08, "end": 386.08, "text": "Bye, Troy."}, {"start": 387.08, "end": 388.08, "text": "How is he?"}, {"start": 388.08, "end": 389.08, "text": "He'll be okay."}, {"start": 389.08, "end": 391.08, "text": "So sweet how much you care about him."}, {"start": 392.08, "end": 394.3988405797101, "text": "And another thing I hate about Die Hard."}, {"start": 394.3988405797101, "end": 396.08, "text": "Two FBI agents named Johnson."}, {"start": 399.08, "end": 401.32806201550386, "text": "I've been thinking about our Inspector Spacetime scenario."}, {"start": 401.32806201550386, "end": 404.08, "text": "It might work better if instead of playing Geneva, you played Rosamund."}, {"start": 404.08, "end": 407.08, "text": "She was a constable in season five, and she only had three lines."}, {"start": 408.08, "end": 409.1043902439024, "text": "I have a better idea."}, {"start": 409.1043902439024, "end": 412.08, "text": "You know what would make your scenarios a lot more realistic?"}, {"start": 412.08, "end": 413.08, "text": "If Troy weren't on a date."}, {"start": 413.08, "end": 418.08, "text": "Why don't you take all your thoughts and your logic and add one step to the process?"}, {"start": 418.08, "end": 419.08, "text": "What are you doing?"}, {"start": 419.08, "end": 421.6725925925926, "text": "From now on, before you do or say anything, you're going"}, {"start": 421.6725925925926, "end": 424.08, "text": "to think about how it affects the people around you."}, {"start": 424.08, "end": 425.90608695652173, "text": "We lower functioning brains."}, {"start": 425.90608695652173, "end": 427.08, "text": "Call this empathy."}, {"start": 427.08, "end": 431.08, "text": "[Screaming]"}, {"start": 431.08, "end": 432.08, "text": "Abed?"}, {"start": 434.08, "end": 435.08, "text": "Abed?"}, {"start": 437.08, "end": 439.08, "text": "Oh my God, I broke Abed."}, {"start": 442.08, "end": 442.3791452991453, "text": "Abed?"}, {"start": 442.3791452991453, "end": 444.9517948717949, "text": "You know how you wanted me to tell you when"}, {"start": 444.9517948717949, "end": 447.88341880341886, "text": "you were being scary weird instead of cute weird?"}, {"start": 447.88341880341886, "end": 449.08, "text": "This is scary weird."}, {"start": 453.08, "end": 454.08, "text": "Hello, Annie."}, {"start": 456.08, "end": 458.6331914893617, "text": "What was I doing on the floor?"}, {"start": 458.6331914893617, "end": 460.08, "text": "Were we doing it?"}, {"start": 461.08, "end": 462.08, "text": "Are you being Jeff?"}, {"start": 463.08, "end": 465.08, "text": "Well, I'm not being a Kardashian."}, {"start": 466.08, "end": 467.08, "text": "So where are we now?"}, {"start": 467.08, "end": 469.08, "text": "We're in the doctor's lounge of Greendale Hospital School."}, {"start": 470.08, "end": 471.08, "text": "Hospital School?"}, {"start": 471.08, "end": 473.4957303370786, "text": "It's a sexy, emotional school where doctors"}, {"start": 473.4957303370786, "end": 476.08, "text": "save lives and make love often simultaneously."}, {"start": 476.08, "end": 478.49379310344824, "text": "Our stories rip from the headlines."}, {"start": 478.49379310344824, "end": 480.08, "text": "Our passions unbridled."}, {"start": 480.08, "end": 481.08, "text": "Our cafeteria?"}, {"start": 483.08, "end": 484.0133333333333, "text": "Make love to me, Ann."}, {"start": 484.0133333333333, "end": 487.08, "text": "I know I'm just a surgeon and you're a hotshot upstart administrator."}, {"start": 487.08, "end": 491.4173493975903, "text": "But damn the rules, damn the system, damn our two-foot height disparity."}, {"start": 491.4173493975903, "end": 492.08, "text": "I want you."}, {"start": 492.08, "end": 493.5037288135593, "text": "Okay, Abed, I get it."}, {"start": 493.5037288135593, "end": 495.673220338983, "text": "We have different sensibilities."}, {"start": 495.673220338983, "end": 496.08, "text": "Later."}, {"start": 500.08, "end": 500.83, "text": "Bye."}, {"start": 500.83, "end": 503.08, "text": "I'm leaving."}, {"start": 512.9839999999999, "end": 513.6506666666666, "text": "Okay, Dr."}, {"start": 513.6506666666666, "end": 517.4284444444444, "text": "Jeff, can you please tell me where I can find Abed?"}, {"start": 517.4284444444444, "end": 518.984, "text": "I owe him an apology."}, {"start": 519.984, "end": 520.984, "text": "Abed, never heard of him."}, {"start": 521.984, "end": 522.984, "text": "Terrific."}, {"start": 525.984, "end": 527.984, "text": "I asked you a question, doctor."}, {"start": 527.984, "end": 528.984, "text": "I'm a surgeon."}, {"start": 528.984, "end": 529.984, "text": "And I'm your administrator."}, {"start": 529.984, "end": 531.984, "text": "I left my wife for you when she was pregnant."}, {"start": 531.984, "end": 533.984, "text": "Who do you think inseminated her?"}, {"start": 534.984, "end": 537.984, "text": "Now tell me what I want to know or God is my witness I'll have your stethoscope."}, {"start": 537.984, "end": 538.5840000000001, "text": "Fine."}, {"start": 538.5840000000001, "end": 538.9440000000001, "text": "Dr."}, {"start": 538.9440000000001, "end": 540.984, "text": "Perry might know."}, {"start": 542.984, "end": 544.984, "text": "Render environment, bio lab."}, {"start": 546.984, "end": 549.984, "text": "Look, there's Britt and Troy fooling around with each other."}, {"start": 549.984, "end": 552.984, "text": "Look, there's Abed having overcome his issues."}, {"start": 552.984, "end": 553.984, "text": "Nice try."}, {"start": 553.984, "end": 554.284, "text": "Dr."}, {"start": 554.284, "end": 555.384, "text": "Barnes, Dr."}, {"start": 555.384, "end": 555.984, "text": "Perry."}, {"start": 557.984, "end": 560.984, "text": "We just saved an uninsured homeless man's life."}, {"start": 560.984, "end": 563.2062222222222, "text": "Using an unapproved procedure."}, {"start": 563.2062222222222, "end": 564.984, "text": "Now we're going to kiss."}, {"start": 571.984, "end": 572.984, "text": "This is what you think I want?"}, {"start": 572.984, "end": 575.984, "text": "What do you want, administrator?"}, {"start": 575.984, "end": 576.984, "text": "I want to talk to Abed."}, {"start": 576.984, "end": 578.984, "text": "There's no one here by that name."}, {"start": 578.984, "end": 579.984, "text": "You're lying."}, {"start": 579.984, "end": 580.5162580645161, "text": "Maybe I am."}, {"start": 580.5162580645161, "end": 580.9033548387097, "text": "So what?"}, {"start": 580.9033548387097, "end": 582.984, "text": "I was raised on the mean streets of Harlem."}, {"start": 582.984, "end": 583.984, "text": "I'm not scared of you."}, {"start": 583.984, "end": 585.984, "text": "Well, be scared of this."}, {"start": 589.984, "end": 592.984, "text": "Sodium pentathol, known commonly as truth serum."}, {"start": 595.984, "end": 598.984, "text": "I saw Abed's name in the hospital school files."}, {"start": 598.984, "end": 600.1643278688525, "text": "I love butt stuff."}, {"start": 600.1643278688525, "end": 601.1479344262295, "text": "I hate spiders."}, {"start": 601.1479344262295, "end": 602.984, "text": "I stole a pen from the bank."}, {"start": 602.984, "end": 604.984, "text": "I cried daring about a boy."}, {"start": 604.984, "end": 606.0951111111111, "text": "The soundtrack."}, {"start": 606.0951111111111, "end": 608.984, "text": "I don't wash my hands before a surgery."}, {"start": 608.984, "end": 611.4601904761905, "text": "I can see why women find Clive Owen attracted to the"}, {"start": 611.4601904761905, "end": 613.984, "text": "point where I might just as well be attracted to him."}, {"start": 613.984, "end": 617.984, "text": "I use comparisons to Hitler to win arguments on the internet at the drop of a hat."}, {"start": 617.984, "end": 619.3004556962026, "text": "I know nothing about wine."}, {"start": 619.3004556962026, "end": 621.984, "text": "I'm more turned on by women in pajamas than lingerie."}, {"start": 621.984, "end": 623.984, "text": "I just want to know they feel comfortable."}, {"start": 623.984, "end": 626.984, "text": "I didn't get inception."}, {"start": 627.984, "end": 629.984, "text": "I didn't get inception."}, {"start": 632.984, "end": 634.984, "text": "You said you saw his name in the files."}, {"start": 634.984, "end": 635.984, "text": "It's so many layers."}, {"start": 636.516, "end": 637.016, "text": "There's--"}, {"start": 637.016, "end": 638.116, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 638.116, "end": 641.236, "text": "Render environment, medical study room."}, {"start": 641.236, "end": 642.5559999999999, "text": "There's Head nurse Shirley talking"}, {"start": 642.5559999999999, "end": 644.636, "text": "to tragic, heart-wrenching Alzheimer's patient"}, {"start": 644.636, "end": 647.836, "text": "and Emmy contender Pierce Hawthorne."}, {"start": 647.836, "end": 648.042511627907, "text": "Mr."}, {"start": 648.042511627907, "end": 650.7959999999999, "text": "Hawthorne, you're out of your bed again."}, {"start": 650.7959999999999, "end": 652.1959999999999, "text": "Because I think I'm on a train."}, {"start": 652.1959999999999, "end": 654.036, "text": "Oh, oh."}, {"start": 654.036, "end": 656.276, "text": "Shirley, get me the file on Abed."}, {"start": 656.276, "end": 657.876, "text": "Abed doesn't exist, young lady."}, {"start": 657.876, "end": 659.236, "text": "He exists if I say so."}, {"start": 659.236, "end": 660.5559999999999, "text": "This is my hospital school."}, {"start": 660.5559999999999, "end": 662.5559999999999, "text": "Your hospital school, young lady, is a simulation."}, {"start": 662.5559999999999, "end": 664.756, "text": "Being run through a filter of other people's needs."}, {"start": 664.756, "end": 666.276, "text": "Abed's been filtered out because nobody"}, {"start": 666.276, "end": 668.516, "text": "needs him."}, {"start": 668.516, "end": 669.396, "text": "I need him."}, {"start": 669.396, "end": 670.476, "text": "Well, you're not singulating."}, {"start": 670.476, "end": 672.7959999999999, "text": "No, but this is."}, {"start": 672.7959999999999, "end": 673.876, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 673.876, "end": 675.716, "text": "Well, there's more where that didn't come from."}, {"start": 675.716, "end": 677.476, "text": "This is a private compartment."}, {"start": 677.476, "end": 679.116, "text": "Jeff, get the files."}, {"start": 679.116, "end": 679.716, "text": "Why me?"}, {"start": 679.716, "end": 682.876, "text": "Because you can see the cabinets."}, {"start": 682.876, "end": 684.076, "text": "And I'll make love to you."}, {"start": 684.076, "end": 684.576, "text": "Jackpot."}, {"start": 688.876, "end": 691.9559999999999, "text": "There is an Abed in this hospital school,"}, {"start": 691.9559999999999, "end": 694.876, "text": "but he's not a doctor."}, {"start": 694.876, "end": 696.036, "text": "He's a patient."}, {"start": 696.036, "end": 697.276, "text": "Notify security."}, {"start": 697.276, "end": 698.076, "text": "Good doctor."}, {"start": 698.076, "end": 699.716, "text": "Jeff, take me to Abed."}, {"start": 699.716, "end": 700.6759999999999, "text": "And where is that?"}, {"start": 700.6759999999999, "end": 701.3159999999999, "text": "Enough games."}, {"start": 701.3159999999999, "end": 703.7959999999999, "text": "Just take me where I want to go."}, {"start": 703.7959999999999, "end": 706.516, "text": "Follow me."}, {"start": 706.516, "end": 707.516, "text": "Are we close?"}, {"start": 707.516, "end": 709.6759999999999, "text": "Almost there, although you should probably run in place"}, {"start": 709.6759999999999, "end": 711.116, "text": "and let the hallway move around you."}, {"start": 718.5559999999999, "end": 719.756, "text": "Here we are."}, {"start": 719.756, "end": 720.596, "text": "Where?"}, {"start": 720.596, "end": 721.996, "text": "Where you wanted to go."}, {"start": 721.996, "end": 725.4359999999999, "text": "The last night of school first year."}, {"start": 725.4359999999999, "end": 727.156, "text": "The night we kissed."}, {"start": 727.156, "end": 730.476, "text": "Abed wasn't there, so whose memory is this?"}, {"start": 730.476, "end": 731.756, "text": "Maybe it's yours."}, {"start": 731.756, "end": 734.236, "text": "Maybe the Dreamatorium really works."}, {"start": 734.236, "end": 736.356, "text": "Or maybe Leonard was watching from the bushes"}, {"start": 736.356, "end": 738.516, "text": "and told Abed about it."}, {"start": 738.516, "end": 741.036, "text": "I don't have cable."}, {"start": 741.036, "end": 742.3159999999999, "text": "Knock it off, Abed."}, {"start": 742.3159999999999, "end": 743.356, "text": "I'm not Abed."}, {"start": 743.356, "end": 744.716, "text": "You're confused."}, {"start": 744.716, "end": 745.7672, "text": "So was I."}, {"start": 745.7672, "end": 747.636, "text": "But not anymore."}, {"start": 747.636, "end": 750.3159999999999, "text": "Jeff, Abed, stop."}, {"start": 750.3159999999999, "end": 751.476, "text": "I don't want to do this."}, {"start": 751.476, "end": 752.9559999999999, "text": "I want to talk to Abed."}, {"start": 755.5559999999999, "end": 756.476, "text": "I'm taking the file."}, {"start": 759.236, "end": 762.516, "text": "Oh, it says Abed is in the recovery parlor."}, {"start": 762.516, "end": 765.276, "text": "Condition, never better."}, {"start": 765.276, "end": 768.6759999999999, "text": "You're not holding anything."}, {"start": 768.6759999999999, "end": 771.236, "text": "This is the file."}, {"start": 771.236, "end": 774.7159999999999, "text": "Abed Nadeer, psychiatric patient 1373."}, {"start": 774.7159999999999, "end": 776.9559999999999, "text": "Control freak with no empathy."}, {"start": 776.9559999999999, "end": 780.236, "text": "People bend over backwards to cater to him."}, {"start": 780.236, "end": 783.356, "text": "Signed, health care administrator Annie Edison."}, {"start": 785.596, "end": 788.7959999999999, "text": "That's out of context."}, {"start": 788.7959999999999, "end": 790.396, "text": "You thought of everything, Annie."}, {"start": 790.396, "end": 792.836, "text": "With Abed gone and Troy and Britta together,"}, {"start": 792.836, "end": 795.076, "text": "there's nothing standing in the way of us."}, {"start": 795.076, "end": 795.996, "text": "Wait, what?"}, {"start": 795.996, "end": 797.156, "text": "Come on."}, {"start": 797.156, "end": 798.876, "text": "This is your dream."}, {"start": 798.876, "end": 801.276, "text": "This is why you played matchmaker."}, {"start": 801.276, "end": 804.476, "text": "This is what's important to you."}, {"start": 804.476, "end": 806.876, "text": "You are not Jeff."}, {"start": 806.876, "end": 809.316, "text": "Because Jeff cares about Abed."}, {"start": 809.316, "end": 811.116, "text": "And I did not push Troy and Britta together,"}, {"start": 811.116, "end": 812.316, "text": "so this would happen."}, {"start": 812.316, "end": 813.9159999999999, "text": "I did it because I thought they were cute together,"}, {"start": 813.9159999999999, "end": 816.236, "text": "and this would have been a bonus."}, {"start": 816.236, "end": 817.756, "text": "And we are not here."}, {"start": 817.756, "end": 819.316, "text": "And I'm not staying here,"}, {"start": 819.316, "end": 821.6759999999999, "text": "because I hate whoever you are."}, {"start": 821.6759999999999, "end": 823.236, "text": "You should probably storm off in--"}, {"start": 823.236, "end": 825.116, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 825.116, "end": 825.9559999999999, "text": "In place."}, {"start": 835.9559999999999, "end": 837.636, "text": "Where do you wanna go next?"}, {"start": 837.636, "end": 839.596, "text": "I wanna be alone."}, {"start": 839.596, "end": 840.4359999999999, "text": "Sounds good to me."}, {"start": 841.316, "end": 844.076, "text": "Execute simulation, Annie/Annie."}, {"start": 847.356, "end": 849.076, "text": "There, now we're alone."}, {"start": 850.276, "end": 852.356, "text": "Great, so you're me now."}, {"start": 852.356, "end": 854.636, "text": "Why are you blowing our magic moment with Jeff?"}, {"start": 854.636, "end": 857.4359999999999, "text": "It's not magic, it's not even real."}, {"start": 857.4359999999999, "end": 859.9559999999999, "text": "But we love Jeff."}, {"start": 859.9559999999999, "end": 861.156, "text": "No, we don't."}, {"start": 862.4359999999999, "end": 865.4359999999999, "text": "We're just in love with the idea of being loved."}, {"start": 865.4359999999999, "end": 867.236, "text": "And if we can teach a guy like Jeff to do it,"}, {"start": 867.236, "end": 868.476, "text": "we'll never be unloved."}, {"start": 868.476, "end": 872.036, "text": "So we keep running the same scenario over and over,"}, {"start": 872.036, "end": 873.4359999999999, "text": "hoping for a different result."}, {"start": 873.4359999999999, "end": 875.116, "text": "Running scenarios?"}, {"start": 875.116, "end": 878.036, "text": "Careful now, you're starting to sound like Abed."}, {"start": 879.836, "end": 883.7159999999999, "text": "So I probably shouldn't say things like Star Wars,"}, {"start": 883.7159999999999, "end": 885.1959999999999, "text": "Zardas, Cougar Town."}, {"start": 885.1959999999999, "end": 886.036, "text": "Cool, cool, cool."}, {"start": 886.036, "end": 887.5559999999999, "text": "Stop it, pop culture, pop culture."}, {"start": 887.5559999999999, "end": 888.516, "text": "I'm on a TV show."}, {"start": 888.516, "end": 890.7159999999999, "text": "You're gonna get in trouble."}, {"start": 890.7159999999999, "end": 891.5559999999999, "text": "- Meta, meta."}, {"start": 892.4359999999999, "end": 893.596, "text": "- It's Abed!"}, {"start": 893.596, "end": 895.356, "text": "I got an Abed here!"}, {"start": 895.356, "end": 896.4359999999999, "text": "Get him!"}, {"start": 896.4359999999999, "end": 899.036, "text": "That's it, I find you guilty of being Abed."}, {"start": 899.036, "end": 900.396, "text": "You're under arrest!"}, {"start": 900.396, "end": 901.636, "text": "- Can I just interject and say"}, {"start": 901.636, "end": 903.036, "text": "I don't know what the hell's going on?"}, {"start": 903.036, "end": 905.7959999999999, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 911.156, "end": 912.836, "text": "- This time you'll never get out."}, {"start": 914.556, "end": 915.396, "text": "Abed?"}, {"start": 918.6759999999999, "end": 919.516, "text": "- Abed?"}, {"start": 919.516, "end": 921.156, "text": "- Yeah, I find you by turning into you."}, {"start": 921.156, "end": 922.156, "text": "How cool is that?"}, {"start": 922.156, "end": 923.636, "text": "- Cool, cool, cool, cool."}, {"start": 923.636, "end": 925.876, "text": "- Tell me where we are so I can pretend to see it."}, {"start": 925.876, "end": 926.756, "text": "- We're inside a locker."}, {"start": 926.756, "end": 928.9559999999999, "text": "That's where I spent a lot of time in junior high."}, {"start": 929.876, "end": 931.556, "text": "- You think this is where we'd put you?"}, {"start": 931.556, "end": 933.1959999999999, "text": "You know that's absurd, right?"}, {"start": 933.1959999999999, "end": 934.4759999999999, "text": "- I'm not stupid."}, {"start": 934.4759999999999, "end": 936.356, "text": "You can see I've increased the square footage."}, {"start": 936.356, "end": 937.9559999999999, "text": "It's a metaphorical locker."}, {"start": 937.9559999999999, "end": 939.1959999999999, "text": "It's a place where people like me get put"}, {"start": 939.1959999999999, "end": 941.076, "text": "when everyone's finally fed up with us."}, {"start": 941.076, "end": 944.1959999999999, "text": "- Abed, so modeling."}, {"start": 944.1959999999999, "end": 945.6759999999999, "text": "If you start turning into a vampire."}, {"start": 945.6759999999999, "end": 946.7959999999999, "text": "- I've run the simulations, Annie."}, {"start": 946.7959999999999, "end": 947.636, "text": "I don't get married."}, {"start": 947.636, "end": 948.6759999999999, "text": "I don't invent a billion dollar website"}, {"start": 948.6759999999999, "end": 949.6759999999999, "text": "that helps people have sex."}, {"start": 949.6759999999999, "end": 952.156, "text": "I don't make it into Sundance, Slamdance, or Dance Pants."}, {"start": 952.156, "end": 953.756, "text": "Troy invents Dance Pants in 2019."}, {"start": 953.756, "end": 954.596, "text": "Don't tell him."}, {"start": 954.596, "end": 955.4359999999999, "text": "He needs to stumble onto it."}, {"start": 955.4359999999999, "end": 958.116, "text": "- Listen, the scenarios you're running here"}, {"start": 958.116, "end": 961.516, "text": "are like great science fiction."}, {"start": 961.516, "end": 964.996, "text": "They're impressive and detailed and insightful,"}, {"start": 964.996, "end": 967.4359999999999, "text": "but they're not accurate for crap."}, {"start": 967.4359999999999, "end": 969.076, "text": "Science fiction never has been."}, {"start": 969.076, "end": 970.7959999999999, "text": "Look at 2001."}, {"start": 970.7959999999999, "end": 972.316, "text": "Did we have a space odyssey?"}, {"start": 972.316, "end": 974.756, "text": "No, we got snowboarding in the Olympics"}, {"start": 974.756, "end": 976.596, "text": "and we over validated Carson Daly."}, {"start": 976.596, "end": 977.4359999999999, "text": "- That poor guy."}, {"start": 977.4359999999999, "end": 978.636, "text": "- Yeah, Crimea River."}, {"start": 978.636, "end": 980.4359999999999, "text": "My point is your simulations"}, {"start": 980.4359999999999, "end": 982.1959999999999, "text": "are nothing more than anxieties."}, {"start": 982.1959999999999, "end": 983.556, "text": "You're afraid you don't fit in."}, {"start": 983.556, "end": 984.996, "text": "You're afraid you'll be alone."}, {"start": 984.996, "end": 986.156, "text": "Great news."}, {"start": 986.156, "end": 988.4359999999999, "text": "You share that with all of us."}, {"start": 988.4359999999999, "end": 991.876, "text": "So you'll never be alone and you'll always fit in."}, {"start": 991.876, "end": 994.756, "text": "And yes, that's why I meddled with Troy and Britta."}, {"start": 994.756, "end": 995.836, "text": "You caught me."}, {"start": 995.836, "end": 998.996, "text": "I was trying to make life go according to some script."}, {"start": 998.996, "end": 1000.116, "text": "I can't."}, {"start": 1000.116, "end": 1001.036, "text": "You can't."}, {"start": 1002.396, "end": 1005.596, "text": "We both need to get more comfortable winging it."}, {"start": 1005.596, "end": 1006.9559999999999, "text": "At least it'll be less work."}, {"start": 1006.9559999999999, "end": 1008.1959999999999, "text": "- I would cut down my dreamatorium time"}, {"start": 1008.1959999999999, "end": 1009.7159999999999, "text": "by 18 hours a week."}, {"start": 1009.7159999999999, "end": 1010.6759999999999, "text": "I could take up yoga."}, {"start": 1010.6759999999999, "end": 1012.7159999999999, "text": "- Do you have the body type?"}, {"start": 1012.7159999999999, "end": 1014.4759999999999, "text": "No, let's get you out of here."}, {"start": 1014.4759999999999, "end": 1015.316, "text": "I don't know how."}, {"start": 1015.316, "end": 1016.836, "text": "These fake shackles don't have a fake key."}, {"start": 1016.836, "end": 1020.356, "text": "- Isn't that what a quantum spammers for?"}, {"start": 1020.356, "end": 1023.7159999999999, "text": "- Technically, no, but that's fine."}, {"start": 1030.876, "end": 1032.876, "text": "- So, did we get back to lunch?"}, {"start": 1032.876, "end": 1033.876, "text": "- I guess so."}, {"start": 1033.876, "end": 1035.636, "text": "A little more anticlimactic than I would have simulated it,"}, {"start": 1035.636, "end": 1036.4759999999999, "text": "but whatever."}, {"start": 1036.4759999999999, "end": 1037.716, "text": "- Anticlimactic?"}, {"start": 1038.636, "end": 1042.396, "text": "Render environment, observer deck, HMS space time 12."}, {"start": 1045.356, "end": 1048.316, "text": "- Inspector, set the tachyon drive to hyper jump."}, {"start": 1048.316, "end": 1050.2759999999998, "text": "We must get to the other side of this star field"}, {"start": 1050.2759999999998, "end": 1051.836, "text": "before the Blorgons intercept."}, {"start": 1053.356, "end": 1055.356, "text": "- Blorgons in this sector?"}, {"start": 1055.356, "end": 1058.076, "text": "Well, this mission has gone pear-shaped indeed."}, {"start": 1058.076, "end": 1059.716, "text": "Prepare to hyper jump on my mark."}, {"start": 1061.076, "end": 1062.4759999999999, "text": "- Bugger, this up comes, Inspector."}, {"start": 1062.4759999999999, "end": 1063.4759999999999, "text": "We're too late."}, {"start": 1063.4759999999999, "end": 1064.316, "text": "Blorgons!"}, {"start": 1067.956, "end": 1070.356, "text": "- Our quantum blasters are useless against their armor."}, {"start": 1070.356, "end": 1072.836, "text": "We're as cooked as Lord Nelson's mutton we are."}, {"start": 1072.836, "end": 1074.556, "text": "- Not if I can help it."}, {"start": 1074.556, "end": 1076.996, "text": "I'll see you on the other side, Inspector."}, {"start": 1076.996, "end": 1078.356, "text": "Wherever that is."}, {"start": 1078.356, "end": 1081.036, "text": "- Don't you mean, whenever that is?"}, {"start": 1083.036, "end": 1085.156, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 1085.156, "end": 1087.516, "text": "- Take that, Blorgons scum!"}, {"start": 1087.516, "end": 1089.356, "text": "You'll blog on me for this later."}, {"start": 1092.836, "end": 1095.636, "text": "Oh my God, Abed, I'm so sorry."}, {"start": 1095.636, "end": 1097.2759999999998, "text": "- No, no, you're committing."}, {"start": 1097.2759999999998, "end": 1098.596, "text": "This is good stuff."}, {"start": 1098.596, "end": 1099.436, "text": "- Thanks."}, {"start": 1101.156, "end": 1103.2359999999999, "text": "- I am Abed Nadeer."}, {"start": 1103.2359999999999, "end": 1105.556, "text": "And I don't know a lot of things everyone else knows."}, {"start": 1105.556, "end": 1107.2759999999998, "text": "I wander the universe with my friend Troy"}, {"start": 1107.2759999999998, "end": 1108.836, "text": "doing whatever I want."}, {"start": 1108.836, "end": 1112.2359999999999, "text": "Sometimes accidentally hurting innocent unremarkables."}, {"start": 1112.2359999999999, "end": 1115.956, "text": "This week, however, Troy went to lunch and I adapted."}, {"start": 1115.956, "end": 1118.916, "text": "I now have the ability to enter the minds of others."}, {"start": 1118.916, "end": 1120.2759999999998, "text": "- I'm hungry, are you hungry?"}, {"start": 1120.2759999999998, "end": 1121.096, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 1121.096, "end": 1122.636, "text": "- I'll make us butter noodles."}, {"start": 1122.636, "end": 1125.656, "text": "- Using an elusive new technique known as empathy."}, {"start": 1127.4759999999999, "end": 1130.2359999999999, "text": "- So, was the other fast food place worth the drive, Shirley?"}, {"start": 1130.2359999999999, "end": 1131.956, "text": "- Well, halfway there, I thought, what am I doing?"}, {"start": 1131.956, "end": 1134.036, "text": "It's the same fast food place in a different location"}, {"start": 1134.036, "end": 1136.516, "text": "and the margins of my life become so narrow."}, {"start": 1136.516, "end": 1138.336, "text": "So I went to the mall and had pizza."}, {"start": 1138.336, "end": 1139.396, "text": "I beat the matrix today."}, {"start": 1139.396, "end": 1141.396, "text": "- Sounds like this has been a game-changing day"}, {"start": 1141.396, "end": 1142.956, "text": "for all of us."}, {"start": 1142.956, "end": 1144.676, "text": "I almost outta my balls."}, {"start": 1144.676, "end": 1148.116, "text": "But at the last second, I made an adjustment."}, {"start": 1148.116, "end": 1149.1490434782609, "text": "- Good job!"}, {"start": 1149.1490434782609, "end": 1150.2759999999998, "text": "- Good work."}, {"start": 1150.2759999999998, "end": 1151.116, "text": "- Good job, ma'am."}, {"start": 1151.116, "end": 1152.916, "text": "- Well, we had a good lunch too."}, {"start": 1152.916, "end": 1153.7559999999999, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 1155.076, "end": 1156.836, "text": "I spoke to the manager about Die Hard"}, {"start": 1156.836, "end": 1158.9560000000001, "text": "and I told him he should be ashamed of himself."}, {"start": 1158.9560000000001, "end": 1160.3159999999998, "text": "- Thanks."}, {"start": 1160.3159999999998, "end": 1161.7959999999998, "text": "Sorry I bailed on the dreamatorium."}, {"start": 1161.7959999999998, "end": 1162.676, "text": "- It's okay."}, {"start": 1162.676, "end": 1164.476, "text": "And he did pretty good in a pinch."}, {"start": 1165.836, "end": 1167.396, "text": "- All right, back to cramming."}, {"start": 1169.156, "end": 1172.3159999999998, "text": "- The people at the bank loved my outfit"}, {"start": 1172.3159999999998, "end": 1174.716, "text": "and they had all kinds of questions about it"}, {"start": 1174.716, "end": 1176.3159999999998, "text": "and my answers seemed to amuse"}, {"start": 1176.3159999999998, "end": 1179.056, "text": "and even liberate them a little."}, {"start": 1179.056, "end": 1180.436, "text": "A few of us went to lunch"}, {"start": 1180.436, "end": 1184.516, "text": "and I had the deepest conversation of my life."}, {"start": 1184.516, "end": 1186.356, "text": "I gotta go, I'm telling everybody."}, {"start": 1188.436, "end": 1190.9560000000001, "text": "- Hmm, maybe after a long dark night,"}, {"start": 1190.9560000000001, "end": 1192.836, "text": "the sun is starting to rise on Greendale."}, {"start": 1192.836, "end": 1194.596, "text": "- Maybe, maybe not."}, {"start": 1195.676, "end": 1198.356, "text": "You never can't tell what kinda day you're gonna have."}, {"start": 1198.356, "end": 1201.036, "text": "- Okay, I didn't really avoid sitting on 'em."}, {"start": 1201.036, "end": 1202.2759999999998, "text": "Sat right on them."}, {"start": 1202.2759999999998, "end": 1205.036, "text": "- Aw, serious, I'm sorry."}, {"start": 1205.036, "end": 1206.196, "text": "- Hurt like hell."}, {"start": 1206.196, "end": 1207.2359999999999, "text": "I saw eagles."}, {"start": 1212.556, "end": 1214.916, "text": "♪ Tryin' to have it in the mornin' ♪"}, {"start": 1214.916, "end": 1216.2759999999998, "text": "- Today we're joined by Annie Edison."}, {"start": 1216.2759999999998, "end": 1217.116, "text": "- Hi."}, {"start": 1217.116, "end": 1218.516, "text": "- She's gonna show us how to spruce up your apartment"}, {"start": 1218.516, "end": 1219.356, "text": "on a budget."}, {"start": 1219.356, "end": 1220.676, "text": "- So Annie, what inspired this throw?"}, {"start": 1220.676, "end": 1222.836, "text": "- Well, I just thought that I'd cover up the stain"}, {"start": 1222.836, "end": 1225.196, "text": "where Abbot spilled code red on the couch last week."}, {"start": 1225.196, "end": 1226.2759999999998, "text": "- Oops, crafty."}, {"start": 1226.2759999999998, "end": 1227.856, "text": "And you have some tips on entertaining."}, {"start": 1227.856, "end": 1229.716, "text": "- Yes, if you're expecting company"}, {"start": 1229.716, "end": 1231.396, "text": "but you don't have enough chairs,"}, {"start": 1231.396, "end": 1233.516, "text": "you can bring out pillows from your bedroom"}, {"start": 1233.516, "end": 1236.2359999999999, "text": "and use them on the floor for a Moroccan feel."}, {"start": 1236.2359999999999, "end": 1238.3159999999998, "text": "- Ooh, a taste of the Orient."}, {"start": 1238.3159999999998, "end": 1241.076, "text": "- Actually boys, I have a little surprise for you."}, {"start": 1241.076, "end": 1243.3159999999998, "text": "While you two were out playing laser tag."}, {"start": 1243.3159999999998, "end": 1244.676, "text": "- That's laser tag with sport coats."}, {"start": 1244.676, "end": 1248.476, "text": "- I did a little extreme bedroom makeover."}, {"start": 1248.476, "end": 1251.356, "text": "I unplugged your bed and got scrap fabric and--"}, {"start": 1251.356, "end": 1254.7959999999998, "text": "("}, {"start": 1254.7959999999998, "end": 1255.636, "text": "- It's okay, buddy."}, {"start": 1255.636, "end": 1256.476, "text": "We can put it back."}, {"start": 1256.476, "end": 1257.3159999999998, "text": "We can put it back the way it was."}, {"start": 1257.3159999999998, "end": 1258.156, "text": "It's okay."}, {"start": 1258.156, "end": 1258.996, "text": "It's okay."}, {"start": 1258.996, "end": 1259.836, "text": "It's okay."}, {"start": 1259.836, "end": 1260.676, "text": "Cut, Garrett."}, {"start": 1260.676, "end": 1261.616, "text": "- I'm sorry."}, {"start": 1261.616, "end": 1264.116, "text": "(dog barking)"}, {"start": 1268.636, "end": 1271.396, "text": "(dramatic music)"}]}